
  Rallypoint server
  -----------------
  Players connect to this machine on UDP port {{ rallypoint_port }}.
  Address to give them: {{ server_address }}:{{ rallypoint_port }}
  Public IPv4 {{ public_ipv4 | default('unknown', true) }}, private IPv4 {{ private_ipv4 | default('none', true) }}
  Public IPv6 {{ public_ipv6 | default('none', true) }} (the server accepts IPv4 only for now)
{% if rallypoint_countries %}  Only these countries are let in: {{ rallypoint_countries }}.
{% endif %}
  This server updates itself: security patches nightly, and Rallypoint itself through Watchtower.

  rallypoint status     is it running?
  rallypoint logs       watch it work
  rallypoint update     get the newest release
  rallypoint key        the fingerprint players compare the first time
  rallypoint help       everything else

  Set up by the Rallypoint Ansible playbook. Changes to this file will be overwritten if you run it again.

